      "content": "Rift is a decentralized exchange (DEX) aggregator that routes swap orders across 20+ venues and bridges to guarantee best-price execution with no added fees. This Router API exposes market quoting, market order creation, and health/provider status endpoints. Reconstructed faithfully from the published API reference at https://docs.rift.trade; the API is in beta.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Rift",
